    "body": "Another problem is that we haven't clearly defined \"potential\" process boundaries. You can `postMessage()` past those, but `SharedArrayBuffer` has to fail somehow (see the issues). So e.g., the main thread can share a `SharedArrayBuffer` with a dedicated worker, but not a shared or service worker. A shared or service worker, is able to share `SharedArrayBuffer` with any workers spawned from it though.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
